# JavaScript Utility Suite

## 📦 8 Powerful JavaScript Utilities

A comprehensive collection of JavaScript modules for various programming tasks.

## 🛠️ Utilities Included

| # | Module | Description |
|---|--------|-------------|
| 1 | **Calculator** | Arithmetic operations |
| 2 | **Todo List** | Task management system |
| 3 | **String Manipulator** | String processing utilities |
| 4 | **Array Utils** | Array manipulation functions |
| 5 | **Weather API** | Weather data simulation |
| 6 | **User Auth** | Authentication system |
| 7 | **File Processor** | File operations |
| 8 | **Data Analyzer** | Statistical analysis |

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Run the demo
```bash
node demo.js
const Calculator = require('./calculator');
const calc = new Calculator();
console.log(calc.add(10, 20)); // 30

